# Credentials for the Wrangler CLI (used by `npm run dev/deploy` and the db:*
# scripts). Optional — `npx wrangler login` does the same job interactively.
#
# To use them: copy this file to .env, uncomment the two lines at the bottom and
# fill them in. .env is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# Create an API token at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens with the
# "Edit Cloudflare Workers" template, plus a D1 → Edit permission (the template
# already covers Workers and R2, but not D1). Find your account ID in the
# Cloudflare dashboard under Workers & Pages → right sidebar.
#
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
